  "outlookText": "000\nACPN50 PHFO 020501\nTWOCP \n\nTropical Weather Outlook\nNWS Central Pacific Hurricane Center Honolulu HI\nIssued by NWS National Hurricane Center Miami FL\n800 PM HST Sun Nov 01 2026\n\nFor the central North Pacific...between 140W and 180W:\n\nWell Southeast of the Hawaiian Islands:\nShowers and thunderstorms associated with a broad area of low\npressure located well east-southeast of the Hawaiian Islands remain\ndisorganized. Environmental conditions appear generally favorable\nfor gradual development of this system, and a tropical depression\ncould form during the middle to latter portions of this week as it\nmoves westward to west-northwestward over the Central Pacific basin.\n* Formation chance through 48 hours...low...10 percent.\n* Formation chance through 7 days...medium...60 percent.\n\n$$\nForecaster Gibbs\nNNNN",
